<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Wharf.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Wharf.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it has issued 150 million American-style call warrants on shares of Wharf (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$37.60	  PREMIUM	  17.19 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6463	 GEARING	  5.58X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.JAN.98	 PAYDATE	  28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   30.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$37.60	  MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p> NOTES		 CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF</p>
<p>			 STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
